Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.93,0:01:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So what...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}...I wanted to say was...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- Yes?\N- "I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"About today,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"and everything I've done so far."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"It won't happen ever again.\NI'll treat you better."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's what I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}but you only have three months to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I live without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so dumbfounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:02:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't live without me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you couldn't live without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean I was certain\NI couldn't live without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was simply wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,if it was possible to do that. I was curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Then we should just die together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an official thing back in\Nthe day. It was called "sunjang."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They buried you with your spouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sunjang.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:03:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, {\i1}sunjang.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can treat me better in the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.51,0:03:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been good\Nat making terrifying jokes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,with a straight face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying not to be dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly did the doctor say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hurting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the doctor really\Nsay it'd only take three...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That you had only three months to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The test result?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you email it to me?\NI don't have time to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free today, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The car is waiting downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't even tell you where we're going.\N- It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to go anywhere with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I have no idea where I'm headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Sungmin University Medical Center{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unlike normal tumors,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}these fuzz-like tumors are scattered.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember being in the lobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so how am I already here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I teleported.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Has this ever happened before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I had headaches and\Nwas often forgetful, and sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Our VIPs loved the art class\Nwe held in the first half year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:05:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We invited famous artists...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Restea will be joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,These days, sleep quality...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ten minutes? Half an hour?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.41,0:06:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sometimes I couldn't remember what\NI did for the past several hours.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought you'd canceled your plans\Nto meet with Director Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I even missed an important appointment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you visit me sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought I'd dozed off or zoned out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,due to exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel any physical pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is there something wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have Cloud Cytoma. It's a very rare disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't many cases worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say you're\Nour first Korean patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do I need surgery?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. It can be treated with medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your case is a bit more complicated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's different from regular tumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a clear lump of tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:08:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The tumor cells are dispersed\Nthroughout your cranial nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're spread over a wide area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the most concentrated\Nnear your temporal lobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe this is the cause of\Nyour temporary memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.65,0:08:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The symptoms are nonspecific\Nand differ from case to case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If it worsens, you could suffer from\Nhallucinations or personality disorders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is, taking\Nmedication won't help much,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and it's too dangerous to receive surgery,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}since the tumor cells have spread too much.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Hong?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Hong?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.95,0:08:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the case for ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what treatment I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know about my case, not theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you're raising money\Nfor a new children's hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take care of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,how I can get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To my knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no current medical solution for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The best we can do is give you medication...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to alleviate your headache\Nand temporary memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's impossible to\Ncure the disease itself for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been insinuating...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'll be dying soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When will I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by the spreading of the tumor cells,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you have about three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he know, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows best as a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking like a stubborn, old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen me eat instant or junk food?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never drunk soda in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.95,0:10:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I enjoyed drinking\Nvegetable juice and watching what I ate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I meditated in the morning and\Ndid yoga at night for my stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched my breathing if there\Nwas no oxygen concentrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've tried to stay healthy\Nsince the moment I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Even people who harm their\Nbodies by drinking, smoking,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,eating whatever they want,\Nand not minding their breathing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't subjected to this disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.93,0:10:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that I'm sick, but why can't they fix me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,People travel to the moon,\Nand cars drive themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but they can't remove a tiny tumor in my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ludicrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How about...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we go to the hospital tomorrow and check again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to be sure. What do\NI do if it's a misdiagnosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you do if it's a misdiagnosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be ecstatic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go and reconfirm everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on edge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget everything and rest up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I can sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too shocked, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can sleep tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure feels different...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,compared to yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Humming? Really? Do you\Nwant to get buried with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be parting ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:13:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be parting ways in three\Nmonths even without a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. She never sleeps in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's past 7 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be in a good mood to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your skin looks better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've slept well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I tossed and turned all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who knows about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so if anyone finds out, it's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but will you keep this a secret forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't your family know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not. They should\Nbe the last ones to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very close to joining the One Billion Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what Grandfather said\Nwhen he gave me the department store.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'll choose you over your father..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"if you make over $1 billion in sales."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to ruin that, when I'm this close?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you won't tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Soo-cheol is the\Ntype who calls my doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to confirm if I really got the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think my mom would be any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find out about my illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be kicked out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:17:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd fight over who'd get my assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Over my dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think Grandfather wants\Nto see me prior to having breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he want to give me an\Nearful and get it over with...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,before eating breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea why he wants to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's about...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.26,0:17:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,how I wanted to launch that\Norganic New York coffee brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you were confident about launching?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those scumbags put one over on me,\Nand decided to work with Yeom Sang-jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this world full of immoral scumbags?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think Grandfather knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:17:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I found out only recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Risks are required to run a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid. It was only {\i1}force\Nmajeure{\i0} that the deal fell through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right. It was only {\i1}force...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.08,0:18:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The deal only fell through due to {\i1}force majeure,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm still worried that he'll get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your grandfather, not Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Be confident and tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- I should, right?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How are you so incompetent?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather, this deal only fell through...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,due to {\i1}force majeure...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A deal fell through?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What deal are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The launching of the organic New York coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about how...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.41,0:18:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you overpaid $8 million...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.79,0:18:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,in corporate tax!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Hyun-woo's legal team...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:19:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,found out about it and will\Nfile a rectification claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That money would've gone down\Nthe drain if it hadn't been for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't your brother-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the finance director?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fire him this instant!\N- But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, you were so confident...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,about that coffee deal. Did\Nthat go down the drain, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- No...\N- Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.57,0:19:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you do anything right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned anything from Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Haven't you?\N- You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something, you scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk, you scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Make use of that mouth of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- I...\N- Answer me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to reply, but I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Jeong thinks he has panic disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:19:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've been so stressed\Nout by your grandfather...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Hyun-woo's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he so good at his job?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my brother's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother worked hard\Nand just made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,$8 million isn't that serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,$8 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this all just because of $8 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.51,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but the results are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.69,0:20:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean she really has three months left?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Exactly three months?\N- I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an irresponsible answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been a neurologist for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be exact with the percentage.\NPlease give us the exact number.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Hae-in. I need to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then. I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you could be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is on the line here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't Hyun-woo picking up?\NIs he in his office?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.31,0:21:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked why you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:22:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if Soo-cheol\Noverpaid a few million dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo could've taken care of it quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather was livid with Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He must've found out somehow.\NHyun-woo wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you were behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no time for that. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,a bit distracted by a serious matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol had...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.17,0:22:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,a panic attack today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.97,0:22:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've been startled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.97,0:22:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.73,0:22:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I just told you that\NI had a serious matter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.40,0:22:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You always know what to do,\Nwhether it's big or small.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.53,0:22:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go. This is my workplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.37,0:23:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to see Hyun-woo, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop provoking us,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.50,0:23:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'll torment your son until the day I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how busy or distracted I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.43,0:23:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- I'll torment him forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.68,0:23:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd just sit and watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you want to eat here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.58,0:23:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't even feel safe in\Nour law firm's meeting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.45,0:23:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A public place like this feels safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.25,0:23:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.17,0:23:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm risking my\Nlife to go against Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.13,0:23:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard after seeing you cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you. Let's have the divorce!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- About that...\N- This wasn't an easy decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm risking my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.86,0:24:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.24,0:24:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.45,0:24:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No? Hey, didn't you tell\Nme it was too unbearable?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that because I saw no end to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.25,0:24:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but now that I see one,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.97,0:24:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can endure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? What end?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.43,0:24:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,God granted me a safe parting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.19,0:24:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain in layman's terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.62,0:25:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Come to Hangang Jamwon\NParking Lot Section One in a half hour.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.47,0:25:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.43,0:25:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm about to tell you is confidential,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.40,0:25:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- so if anyone finds out, it's your fault.\N- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.15,0:25:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.33,0:25:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.84,0:25:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me when I was about\Nto give her the divorce papers,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.51,0:25:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,that she had three months left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.42,0:25:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I met with her doctor today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.34,0:26:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.18,0:26:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.77,0:26:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane. What am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.39,0:26:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,First...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.06,0:26:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's shake hands.\N- Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you shouldn't show your happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.90,0:26:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be the scumbag,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.03,0:26:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so Lady Luck is on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.95,0:26:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You would've left her without\Na single penny to your name...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.99,0:26:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,if you'd gotten a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.33,0:26:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Those few seconds saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.33,0:26:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Does this mean you'll take over Queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.54,0:26:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.09,0:26:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- they're that dumb?\N- What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.34,0:26:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she sign a prenup or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.26,0:26:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,About not dividing her assets?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.92,0:26:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it won't matter once you file a suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.05,0:26:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,unless she wrote it in her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she wrote it...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.89,0:26:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,in her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.14,0:26:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.98,0:26:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.85,0:26:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened before we got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.57,0:26:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She refused to give anything to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.82,0:26:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and even got the will notarized...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.86,0:27:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,before we got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.91,0:27:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Conglomerates sure are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.12,0:27:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're extremely thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.66,0:27:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.62,0:27:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.75,0:27:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,that I can escape from them\Nsafe and sound in three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.47,0:27:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did God give you those three months?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.14,0:27:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.89,0:27:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Attorney Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.97,0:27:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk professionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.14,0:27:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You know she's free to revise\Nher will in those three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to win her\Nover in the next three months,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.11,0:27:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so she'll think, "Gosh,\Nhe must love me so much."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.99,0:27:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"I should hand over my beloved\NQueens Department Store before I die."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.08,0:27:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.16,0:27:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Three months is nothing after\Nserving two years in the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.25,0:27:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider that and it'll be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.87,0:27:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your heart and soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.54,0:27:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,into loving her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.80,0:28:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you seriously think...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.02,0:28:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm that materialistic?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.03,0:28:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.44,0:28:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is our wedding anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.06,0:28:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.12,0:28:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd made a reservation and\Nprepared a surprise two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but you got very upset and\Ntold me not to make a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.87,0:28:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- So I didn't prepare anything last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.16,0:28:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but you still got angry\Nthat I actually listened,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.32,0:28:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and asked if I'd die if you told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.13,0:28:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to nitpick about my inconsistency?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.55,0:28:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.38,0:28:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person brings flowers to nitpick?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.14,0:28:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then has our marriage ever been so\Nlovely that you'd bring flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.31,0:28:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,on our anniversary?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.64,0:28:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.48,0:28:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say yes to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.81,0:29:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but we could always make it lovely, can't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.86,0:29:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.04,0:29:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,wedding anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.14,0:29:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me a vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.14,0:29:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How are things?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.81,0:29:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they fight or anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.90,0:29:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they didn't. Rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Rather"?\N- They've gotten closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.49,0:29:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Closer"?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.40,0:29:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He takes great care of her.\NIt's very unlike him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.58,0:29:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Has this table always been for ten?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.75,0:29:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.26,0:30:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always been just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.93,0:30:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but we sat so far apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.23,0:30:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.44,0:30:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.56,0:30:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,be sitting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.97,0:30:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many cons in the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:31:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to provide the store's renovation fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.14,0:31:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's that\Nbig of a loss on our part,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.52,0:31:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,given the popularity of the brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.57,0:31:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct, but they're not required\Nto stay for a certain amount of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.95,0:31:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say we spent $5 million...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.03,0:31:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.87,0:31:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no right to stop them\Nif they want to leave after a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.74,0:31:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're also required to pay\Na penalty if they find out...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.91,0:31:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,people are selling counterfeit products.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.71,0:31:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.38,0:31:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. I'm okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.63,0:31:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk. Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.47,0:31:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please call the ambulance.\N- Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.89,0:31:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.89,0:31:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.60,0:31:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I just choked on some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.27,0:31:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.77,0:31:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.61,0:31:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we resume?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.57,0:31:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for the ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.41,0:32:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.79,0:32:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just trying to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.50,0:32:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.75,0:32:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you later. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.13,0:32:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If he'd stayed still,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.34,0:32:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,she would've been furious\Nthat he didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.88,0:32:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I really feel bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.85,0:32:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold. You should just wait inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.69,0:32:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.82,0:32:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you catch a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.74,0:32:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.45,0:32:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are your hands so cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.63,0:32:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Na, is the car coming soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.80,0:32:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.13,0:32:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I call an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.64,0:33:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.99,0:33:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.75,0:33:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.62,0:33:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They should just argue instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.21,0:33:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.30,0:33:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.14,0:33:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.77,0:33:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, I don't know how to be dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.86,0:33:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This{\i0} is being dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.87,0:34:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.38,0:34:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know why...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.89,0:34:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo reminds me of Grace Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.06,0:34:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't she get married to a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.81,0:34:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- He reminds me of Diana.\N- That's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.02,0:34:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.44,0:34:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry.\N- Mi-seon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.65,0:34:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to get my hair done, not pulled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.94,0:34:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.48,0:34:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because we're housewives,\Nbut you really don't treat us well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.36,0:34:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- I agree.\N- Be honest with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.95,0:34:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it annoy you when we\Ntalk about Hyun-woo's looks?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.32,0:34:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo has always been good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.91,0:34:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.00,0:34:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.19,0:34:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.21,0:34:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- About what?\N- The daughter of the electronics store.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.71,0:34:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Whose in-laws are doctors?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.54,0:34:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're getting a divorce.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.17,0:34:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Seriously?\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.59,0:34:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodness.\N- Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.97,0:35:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, that's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.89,0:35:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Divorces are common these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.60,0:35:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There are even TV shows\Nthat feature divorced couples.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a shame to be divorced these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.19,0:35:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Her mom must be so\Nhumiliated to see her neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.36,0:35:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She used to brag all the time\Nabout her son-in-law's being a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.36,0:35:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she was a doctor too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.86,0:35:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She always gave advice\Nto others if they were unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.57,0:35:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tell me about it.\N- Why are they splitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.51,0:35:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too different.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.70,0:35:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.24,0:35:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The marriage won't last if the wife\Nand the husband are too different,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.08,0:35:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not saying that's always the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.30,0:35:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Hyun-woo happily married?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.38,0:35:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.68,0:35:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.39,0:35:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Those in Seoul look down on people like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.14,0:35:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.22,0:35:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and Hyun-woo is married\Nto a conglomerate family.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.14,0:35:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister-in-law isn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.40,0:35:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.11,0:35:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't she attend\Nyour dad's 60th birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.03,0:36:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,People started gossiping afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.95,0:36:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Saying?\N- That they're not on good terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.87,0:36:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They think Hyun-woo isn't treated well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.83,0:36:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Only those who don't treat their in-laws well...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.94,0:36:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,attend birthday parties\Nand pretend like they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.75,0:36:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But people like her who\Nare good to their in-laws...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.03,0:36:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,don't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.25,0:36:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, but are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.01,0:36:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I be angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.46,0:36:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then loosen up those fists,\Nor you're going to land a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.68,0:36:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- I have a headache.\N- What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.72,0:36:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- She's angry.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.43,0:36:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire body is sore today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.31,0:36:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't throw things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.40,0:36:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinky is watching, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo, that idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.07,0:36:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it. Studying law at SNU\Nprobably made him arrogant,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.41,0:36:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,so it must've been difficult to\Nbrown-nose a conglomerate family,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.26,0:36:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but wouldn't it be better to\Nbrown-nose them, if anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.08,0:36:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I brown-nose\Nmiddle-schoolers every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.54,0:36:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- So they register for the next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not my hands that\Nkeep me in business, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.96,0:36:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all. It's my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gosh, you're so beautiful\Ntoday. Your skin is glowing!"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.92,0:37:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"You look ten years younger with\Nthis new haircut." That's what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.09,0:37:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish Hyun-woo could be like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.97,0:37:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.10,0:37:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I doted on him too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.93,0:37:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, shouldn't you do something about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.89,0:37:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- He might actually get a divorce.\N- A divorce isn't a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.52,0:37:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.98,0:37:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,People divorce when they think\Nthey're on the brink of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.24,0:37:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better to divorce then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.32,0:37:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The noodles are tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.16,0:37:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,More sesame oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.99,0:37:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, add more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.67,0:37:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I prepared different meals for each of you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.51,0:37:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}based on last week's blood test results.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.38,0:37:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the vice chairman,\NI prepared a low-FODMAP diet...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.18,0:37:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,for your irritable bowel syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.39,0:37:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.15,0:38:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.15,0:38:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to fast for his\Nmedical checkup tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.86,0:38:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet he'll live up to 120 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.87,0:38:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine doesn't have any meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.95,0:38:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because of your cholesterol.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.73,0:38:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.82,0:38:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.84,0:38:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll receive a certification\Nof contents tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.67,0:38:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to file a suit for how\Nyou built your department store...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.72,0:38:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,over my land in Gwanggyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.43,0:38:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We already talked about this\Nwhen the construction began,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.06,0:38:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and it wasn't that much land.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.89,0:38:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen. All wars began because\None party stepped over...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.85,0:38:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- another party's land.\N- You gave me your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.11,0:38:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, but Attorney Shim was against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.03,0:38:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumors might spread about\Nhow I gave you special treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.16,0:38:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and I might have to pay a gift tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.62,0:38:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to file a suit,\Nnow that the building...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.29,0:38:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,has already been built?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.46,0:38:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't opened yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.00,0:39:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Then should I just demolish it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.17,0:39:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, she doesn't want to prolong the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.38,0:39:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants to negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.84,0:39:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hyun-woo.\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.84,0:39:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over it with her, and come\Nup with an appropriate measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.10,0:39:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"An appropriate measure"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.98,0:39:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean? Should\NI be afraid and back off?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.61,0:39:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you meant\Nwhen you said bring it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.28,0:39:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're threatening me with that lawsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.32,0:39:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.78,0:39:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.70,0:39:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.70,0:39:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just cut me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.23,0:39:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but since you've already filed a complaint,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll look over it and give you our reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the press will learn\Nabout this in the process,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.59,0:39:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and that could cause a fall\Nin the stock price and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.05,0:39:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to inform her grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:39:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.35,0:40:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am. Then that'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.98,0:40:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's feeling a bit unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.63,0:40:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to keep it a secret from your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.49,0:40:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.50,0:40:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But wouldn't they suspect something's up,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.80,0:40:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're all tense and\Nyour fists are trembling?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.26,0:40:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I know I was acting out of character,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.52,0:40:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.94,0:40:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You interrupted my mom and sided with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.60,0:40:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You also looked me in the eye lovingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the most suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.95,0:40:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just act as you always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you ever peel shrimp for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.17,0:41:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It just won't work for us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.68,0:41:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.68,0:41:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we change after\Nyears of living as strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.56,0:41:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But wasn't that the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.76,0:41:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- three years ago?\N- What was?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.15,0:41:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.11,0:41:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- That was...\N- You were both head over heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.40,0:41:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She visited you on a helicopter...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.78,0:41:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and disobeyed her parents. You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.61,0:41:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't sane back then, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.24,0:41:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You were crazy in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.20,0:41:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so wasn't that love?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.16,0:41:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.29,0:41:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right, but\Nlet me give you an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.71,0:41:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We learn how to survive in water as\Nkids. Then we don't swim for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.91,0:41:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we end up in water\Nagain, we'll still float.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.19,0:41:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You may think you forgot it all,\Nbut your body remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.38,0:41:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.72,0:41:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You may think you forgot how to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.89,0:42:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but your heart remembers once you get into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.47,0:42:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't like swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.27,0:42:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it is. Being in love isn't special.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.44,0:42:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.73,0:42:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We get married because we're in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.78,0:42:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so why does that love disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.49,0:42:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As a divorce attorney,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.28,0:42:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the problem is\Nthat marriage is exclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.45,0:42:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Couples don't find the need to try,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.29,0:42:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so they get disappointed and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.08,0:42:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they come to me. Marriage\Njust makes it impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.67,0:42:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,to stay in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.84,0:42:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you think so?\N- I think it's best not to marry,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.14,0:42:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,if you want to be in love for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.71,0:43:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please accept this as a\Ntoken of my love and loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.86,0:43:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.40,0:43:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy? She's not your "Honey."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.28,0:43:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Secretary Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.65,0:43:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.99,0:43:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting married? You two?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.87,0:43:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And in Korea at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.04,0:43:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.54,0:43:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've heard I was in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.04,0:43:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.46,0:43:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But what a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.05,0:43:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.31,0:44:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.64,0:44:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.10,0:44:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd spare your life...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.02,0:44:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you left the country and lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.27,0:44:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right.\N- So how dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.73,0:44:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,get married in front of all your relatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.36,0:44:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,when you cheated on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.62,0:44:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.79,0:44:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.30,0:44:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.30,0:44:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.78,0:45:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, you have blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.57,0:45:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.41,0:45:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where?\N- On your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.00,0:45:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't do this when you're on probation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.25,0:45:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You could get aggravated\Npunishment for assault and defamation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.01,0:45:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Defamation? What I've done so far\Nto those cheaters is far from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.47,0:45:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I show you what true defamation is like?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.88,0:45:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You could be behind bars\Nuntil you're 60 if you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.93,0:45:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Will that be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.56,0:45:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've settled with their attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.39,0:45:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.44,0:45:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to know?\N- Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.23,0:45:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be enough to build a pool in their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.56,0:45:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.23,0:45:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still resent them?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.24,0:45:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.78,0:45:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- I quit.\N- Because I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.53,0:45:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned how to smoke because\Nall my ex-husbands cheated on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.96,0:45:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't smoke here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.29,0:46:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.29,0:46:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.72,0:46:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.76,0:46:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dying to get out of jail,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.34,0:46:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but now that I'm out, there's nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.68,0:46:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.27,0:46:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.36,0:46:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.62,0:46:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you didn't eat all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.46,0:46:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to you if I starve to death or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.34,0:46:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You put me behind bars because you didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.67,0:46:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, it I wasn't the one who did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.76,0:46:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You assaulted an innocent woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.18,0:46:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so you were punished for your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.93,0:46:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.35,0:47:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman who killed Mom and\Nbecame the madam of the home...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.99,0:47:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,is completely innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.23,0:47:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not the madam of the home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.11,0:47:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not in our family register.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.28,0:47:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All I did was gently grab her by\Nthe hair, but I'm the sinner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.41,0:47:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't say it was gentle\Nwhen her disc slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.08,0:47:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, so mind your own business\Nand let me die for slipping her disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.00,0:47:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.71,0:47:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the wrong idea about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.76,0:47:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Seul-hee doesn't want anything from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.97,0:47:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not interested in\Nfortune or becoming family.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.64,0:47:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even scarier.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.64,0:47:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What grand plan could she be scheming\Nto live with you and not want anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.56,0:47:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a geezer with tons of money!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.19,0:47:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.07,0:47:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.32,0:47:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder when she'll wise up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.91,0:47:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have hope since\Nshe's already in her fifties, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.20,0:48:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.87,0:48:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I know I'm no match for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.83,0:48:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're not focused on the game at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.67,0:48:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.30,0:48:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodness.\N- Staring at the board won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.31,0:48:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to see the bigger picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.68,0:48:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.60,0:48:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get caught if you run away in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.44,0:48:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you try to catch the tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.86,0:48:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,without being prepared,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.45,0:48:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.20,0:48:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.41,0:48:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why {\i1}janggi{\i0} can teach you life lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.20,0:49:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I took over your palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.82,0:49:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will the king flee to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.53,0:49:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.99,0:49:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see this coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.96,0:49:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,or were you just lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.63,0:49:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.21,0:49:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to grant me one favor, since you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.21,0:49:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.47,0:49:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when I have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.98,0:49:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.40,0:49:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I just saw a shooting star.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.44,0:49:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know I could see them in Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.03,0:49:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You dreamed of shooting\Nstars before having Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.91,0:50:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.41,0:50:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You were excited because you\Nthought you'd be having a baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.33,0:50:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. I don't quite remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.13,0:50:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, don't be so harsh on Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.17,0:50:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.51,0:50:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will you let your past haunt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.39,0:50:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You should let go and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.27,0:50:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you said back then.\NYour father didn't want any issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.27,0:50:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so you obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.86,0:50:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand why Su-wan had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.65,0:50:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just an accident. No one is to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.86,0:50:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. It's no one's fault,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.74,0:50:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but Su-wan is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.12,0:50:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still upset and in pain every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.08,0:50:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To others...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.25,0:50:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,To you, it's just a past event,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.29,0:50:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but I relive that moment every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.26,0:50:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm haunted by the day when I lost my child,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.47,0:51:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't expect me to be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.02,0:51:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't she come home yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.40,0:51:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she really sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.11,0:51:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She has great stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.45,0:52:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}To be honest, her chance\Nof survival is very low,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.99,0:52:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but miracles do happen.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.70,0:52:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sorry?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.41,0:52:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}How often do these miracles occur?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.58,0:52:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Do they happen often?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.54,0:52:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}During my 30 years as a doctor,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.80,0:52:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I've witnessed many patients\Nrecover miraculously...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.88,0:52:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}from even less hopeful illnesses.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.35,0:52:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Don't lose hope.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.35,0:52:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}clinical cases for brain tumors{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.56,0:52:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Malignant tumor\NDon't give up on treatment{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.82,0:52:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Given three months to live,\Nbut still alive after 30 years."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.58,0:52:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,30 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.71,0:52:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.92,0:53:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was this common.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.72,0:53:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess a doctor's\Nprediction isn't always correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.68,0:53:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is... Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.47,0:53:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unlike the dramas.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.27,0:53:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"The tumors disappeared after\Nwaking up. A medically impossible case."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.90,0:53:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How could it be medically impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.98,0:53:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the reality...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.20,0:53:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,of modern medicine? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.31,0:54:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Terminally-ill patients can still recover{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.03,0:54:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Given 3 months to live,\Nbut still alive after 30 years{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.00,0:55:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}The miraculous healing of my pancreatic cancer{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.54,0:55:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Those who cling to hope{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.10,0:55:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.73,0:55:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.77,0:55:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you sleeping here? Sleep on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.69,0:55:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.24,0:55:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You should too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.66,0:55:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.59,0:55:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.51,0:55:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.72,0:55:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.64,0:55:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspected you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.94,0:56:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.23,0:56:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be happy to hear I was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.57,0:56:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that was why you\Nwere being so good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.70,0:56:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I also suspected you had...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.58,0:56:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,an ulterior motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.37,0:56:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit it...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.00,0:56:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a bit suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.09,0:56:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you'd looked up those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.72,0:56:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,These miracles happen more often than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.85,0:56:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.73,0:56:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.90,0:56:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll live, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.12,0:56:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I acted tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.58,0:57:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was shocked to hear my diagnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.16,0:57:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dispirited.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.67,0:57:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A part of me didn't care about\Nwhat would happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.25,0:57:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"If I really had only three months,"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.92,0:57:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"would receiving treatment even help?"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.13,0:57:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Should I just give up?"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.64,0:57:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"No one would mourn my death,"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.68,0:57:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"not even my family."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.06,0:57:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I had all sorts of thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.73,0:57:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.31,0:57:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.82,0:57:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You of all people want me to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.41,0:57:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.78,0:57:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.16,0:57:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.83,0:57:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd been tough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.75,0:57:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It was too much to handle,\Nbut seeing you gives me hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.01,0:57:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my own research.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.09,0:57:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike in Korea, there\Nwere similar cases abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.97,0:58:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many labs out there\Nthat are developing new drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.85,0:58:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be able to speed up the process,\Nas long as they have the funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.69,0:58:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to actively look into supporting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.61,0:58:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.15,0:58:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.36,0:58:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.58,0:58:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.96,0:58:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.83,0:58:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die that easily, for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.42,0:59:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this for your social-media account?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.13,0:59:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's just a part of your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.22,0:59:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want the world to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.18,0:59:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But the media will post articles about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.22,0:59:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and your parents don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.18,0:59:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to worry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.43,0:59:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really...!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.60,0:59:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.02,0:59:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.02,0:59:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jun-ho told me to keep it a secret,\Nsince it wasn't confirmed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.95,0:59:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Our finance director? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.03,0:59:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He feels terrible about the $8 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.03,0:59:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.60,0:59:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.62,0:59:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to hook you up with\Nsomeone to make up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.87,0:59:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who?\N- A private equity fund investor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.29,0:59:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.46,0:59:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,who invested in the organic\Ncoffee deal for Yeom Sang-jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.80,0:59:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.05,1:00:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is David Yoon. He's Korean-American.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.18,1:00:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He recently came to Korea.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has control of Middle Eastern oil money,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.31,1:00:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and he's here to find new investments.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.56,1:00:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's looking to invest at\Nleast a couple billion dollars.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.24,1:00:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hae-in has been trying to\Nbring Hercyna into her store,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.08,1:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and David is the reason\Nthe brand could launch...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.13,1:00:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}their first Asian flagship store in Seoul.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.77,1:00:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.36,1:00:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.94,1:01:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. I'm loving your\Nfood section's new renovation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.44,1:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I eat at your food court often these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.99,1:01:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I heard you came by often.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.62,1:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Royal still has a long\Nway to go to be on your level.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.79,1:01:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our desserts need some tweaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.12,1:01:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a lot to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.50,1:01:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the fountain plaza\Nis built on the first floor,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.63,1:01:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,we're going to bring in Hercyna,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.30,1:01:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll work from there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.68,1:01:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we need to work harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.13,1:01:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if our food section is great?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.39,1:01:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A department store without\NHercyna is just a big restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.47,1:01:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We also have space for Hercyna.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.81,1:01:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want a tip?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.15,1:01:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, if you want to give me one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.19,1:01:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.90,1:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know that Mr. Hermann...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.36,1:01:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,puts company value and\Nmindset before anything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.95,1:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He believes that those who form\Ngood relationships with others...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.33,1:01:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,are the best business partners.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.37,1:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his belief.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.00,1:01:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.96,1:02:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here has brought their\Nspouse, lover, or family members.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.81,1:02:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one here...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.80,1:02:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,who came alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.80,1:02:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.26,1:02:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You impress me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.43,1:02:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows you have no friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.39,1:02:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but how could you think of coming\Nhere of all places by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.77,1:02:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only lone wolf here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.82,1:02:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.74,1:02:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.21,1:02:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.51,1:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where are you?\N- {\i1}I'm in a trial.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.85,1:03:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.19,1:03:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.19,1:03:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You were frantically calling\Nyour husband for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.61,1:03:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.74,1:03:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's in a trial.\N- How fitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.91,1:03:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- What can you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.33,1:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't tell him to bail.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.54,1:03:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that was a fitting excuse.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.12,1:03:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not an excuse. He's really in a trial.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.00,1:03:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so serious? I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.05,1:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't mind the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.47,1:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.97,1:03:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- What rumors?\N- I'm sure you heard...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.26,1:03:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that you two have separated\Nand will divorce soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.02,1:03:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That he only married you for your money.\NI don't even want to talk about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.52,1:03:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.52,1:03:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've barely begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.11,1:03:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've had an ordinary marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.36,1:03:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even gossipers wouldn't have much\Nto talk about if you'd married someone...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.65,1:03:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,on your own level.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.49,1:03:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've realized something in life.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.45,1:03:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Marriage is about finding a life partner...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.79,1:04:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,who looks in the same direction as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.67,1:04:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My past four years of marriage...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.75,1:04:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,have been nothing but peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.42,1:04:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and that piqued my curiosity about\Ncouples who couldn't get along.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.80,1:04:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel? I've never\Nbeen angry with my husband before.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.30,1:04:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.68,1:04:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take your anger out on me...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.18,1:04:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,for not being loved by your husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.40,1:04:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've just married Yoon Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.61,1:04:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you suddenly bring him up?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.49,1:04:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.41,1:04:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Mr. Hermann's right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.75,1:04:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the key to reaching Mr. Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.54,1:04:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.13,1:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he became really successful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.26,1:04:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the same guy from college.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.09,1:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in charge of managing\Nsheikhs' finances now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.64,1:04:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I went to greet him at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.85,1:05:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.16,1:05:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.08,1:05:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've let me know\Nif you were back in Korea.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.67,1:05:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember the\Nlast thing you said to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.04,1:05:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To not contact you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.80,1:05:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- I did?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.17,1:05:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.88,1:05:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Let's continue to stay in touch."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.85,1:05:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what I said?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.94,1:05:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I told you not\Nto reach out to me ever again,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.98,1:05:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,because you kept crossing the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.49,1:05:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, but now...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.32,1:06:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems you have something to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.04,1:06:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you already know this,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.21,1:06:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll just say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.37,1:06:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ye-na and I are in a brutal competition...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.92,1:06:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring Hercyna into our stores.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.00,1:06:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you have a good\Nrelationship with Mr. Hermann,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.09,1:06:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.68,1:06:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can you help me?\N- Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.38,1:06:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.14,1:06:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't remember much of the past,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.35,1:06:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so why don't we just say we broke up...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.69,1:06:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,on good terms?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.68,1:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}When will the trial end? Is it almost over?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.47,1:07:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- What about the trial?\N- I won.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.89,1:07:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I won quickly to come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.57,1:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.99,1:08:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One non-alcoholic cocktail, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.91,1:08:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say marriage was again?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.87,1:08:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding a life partner who looked\Nin the same direction as you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.84,1:09:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't get it at first, but\Nseeing your husband made it clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.84,1:09:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.72,1:09:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.51,1:09:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather look at my husband than elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.64,1:09:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's that handsome.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.48,1:09:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.65,1:09:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, have you tried this yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.82,1:09:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really something.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.12,1:09:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you come here to eat?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.91,1:09:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.33,1:09:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.13,1:09:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.17,1:09:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A heart? You little...!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.06,1:09:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.60,1:09:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.11,1:10:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of Hae-in now and then,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.03,1:10:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so it feels odd...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.90,1:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to meet her husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.99,1:10:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.49,1:10:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Hae-in and I...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.37,1:10:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,had a good relationship in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.92,1:10:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in isn't the type...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.55,1:10:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,who has had many good\Nrelationships in her lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.22,1:10:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.85,1:10:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.06,1:10:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I liked her a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.41,1:10:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.98,1:10:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.03,1:10:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.24,1:10:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That only means one of two things.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.82,1:10:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You trust her completely,\Nor you just don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.12,1:10:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the latter?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.75,1:11:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.80,1:11:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.30,1:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.85,1:11:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.61,1:11:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.82,1:11:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he know?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.57,1:11:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm offended.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.33,1:11:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.46,1:11:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}To be honest, I liked her a lot.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.09,1:11:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If he truly...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.42,1:11:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,liked her a lot,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.67,1:11:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,then he should've worked hard and married her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.43,1:11:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he would've saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.35,1:11:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of telling\Nme about his feelings now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.98,1:12:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he teasing me, or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.57,1:12:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What an annoying scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.92,1:13:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.09,1:13:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- We meet again.\N- Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.67,1:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh. Isn't this place teeming?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.01,1:13:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.35,1:13:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,More than half of these people came to see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.02,1:13:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.65,1:13:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.78,1:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's a tycoon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.40,1:13:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the wealthiest people from Wall Street...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.43,1:13:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,borrow oil money from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.24,1:13:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Chairman Yeom is dying to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.75,1:13:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol is trying to meet with him too,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.04,1:13:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.54,1:13:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And this Yoon Eun-sung attended\Nthe same college as Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.88,1:13:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.88,1:13:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say\Nto you in times like these.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.80,1:13:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you feel bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.09,1:13:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've introduced...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.47,1:14:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,someone like him to Ms. Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.72,1:14:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What can she do? She dug her own grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.48,1:14:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I regret not trying harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.52,1:14:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To do what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.24,1:14:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.91,1:14:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always grateful...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.29,1:14:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that you didn't try harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.91,1:14:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly thankful that you\Nexcluded me from your list...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.38,1:14:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,of marriage candidates,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.75,1:14:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so spare yourself that useless guilt.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.30,1:14:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you call?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.30,1:14:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You overheard us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.85,1:14:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite Yoon Eun-sung to our family hunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.52,1:14:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I can guarantee\Nhe'll come if I tell him to,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.32,1:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but why should I do that? I have no reason to.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.78,1:15:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll withdraw...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.12,1:15:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the lawsuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.73,1:15:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.24,1:17:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the number of prey you can catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.70,1:17:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no limit for magpies and crows.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.91,1:17:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,As for boar, water deer, and pheasants,\Nyou can each catch a maximum of five.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.46,1:17:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,An accident might occur if\Nyou get in each other's way,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.71,1:17:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and mistake each other for an animal,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.05,1:17:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so make sure you stay in your course.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.72,1:17:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't hunt boar by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.72,1:17:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't aim or turn your\Nback on them if you're alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.47,1:17:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we let her use a firearm?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.81,1:17:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,As you already know...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.89,1:17:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do? She chose to carry one.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.94,1:17:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she commits murder?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.28,1:17:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that murderous look.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.82,1:17:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She should've gone...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.45,1:17:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,to a mental hospital, not jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.37,1:17:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.54,1:17:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt, we need to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.96,1:17:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.00,1:18:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold the firearm like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.47,1:18:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I hit it? I can't see very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.39,1:18:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You did, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.73,1:18:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest one fell. Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.40,1:18:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it too, Grandfather. Gosh!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.15,1:18:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you? I believe I did too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.57,1:18:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.78,1:18:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.53,1:18:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think any of them fell.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.62,1:18:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo, are you a Native American,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.08,1:18:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,or a Mongolian hunter?\NIs your vision that great?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.67,1:18:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it fell into the woods.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.84,1:18:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell our men to get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.30,1:18:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Hyun-woo goes home\Nempty-handed this year, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.47,1:18:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.14,1:18:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.47,1:18:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never caught anything on our hunts.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.61,1:19:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We come here every year. You should learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.61,1:19:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of guns?\NYou served in the military,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.99,1:19:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so should I teach you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.45,1:19:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay. You should worry about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.24,1:19:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already good at it. That's\Nwhy I offered to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.54,1:19:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you? Are you any good?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.75,1:19:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. I doubt I can\Nhold a candle to you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.17,1:19:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's humble in every way.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.09,1:19:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.42,1:19:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see who'll catch the\Npheasants for this year's {\i1}mandu{\i0} soup.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.51,1:19:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.43,1:19:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.64,1:19:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go.\N- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.91,1:19:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch something for once.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.58,1:19:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason my grandfather\Nbrings us to this mountain...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.66,1:19:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,to hunt every year.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.33,1:20:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.33,1:20:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he want us to pretend\Nhe successfully shot a duck,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.13,1:20:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and praise him?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.46,1:20:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stamina is important when hunting,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.42,1:20:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but quick judgment and objective\Ndecisions are also required,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.13,1:20:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and those are all virtues that\Nthose who do business should have.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.68,1:20:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you catch so many every year,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.60,1:20:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to prove to him that you're\Na worthy businesswoman?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.81,1:20:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.48,1:20:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll catch the most this year too.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.32,1:20:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.24,1:20:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.91,1:20:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's near the middle...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.33,1:20:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,of that course.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.42,1:20:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Wild Boar Habitat{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.54,1:20:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Restricted Area\NProperty Owned by Queens{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.19,1:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where in the world is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.69,1:21:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your call cannot be connected.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.24,1:21:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.35,1:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I thought you were a water deer.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.27,1:21:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.31,1:21:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't your course.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.90,1:21:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it? This is my first time hunting.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.28,1:21:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know it could be fatal to invade\Nsomeone else's territory when hunting?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.08,1:22:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.24,1:22:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to learning more from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.14,1:22:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't do anything\Nin other people's territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.77,1:22:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted me to teach you, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.92,1:22:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.38,1:22:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just a {\i1}mandu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.47,1:22:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just pheasant soup.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.97,1:22:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pheasant {\i1}mandu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.64,1:23:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pheasant soup.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.37,1:24:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fool yourself. This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.17,1:24:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.17,1:24:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.03,1:24:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What do you say?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.99,1:24:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm dying. I have three months left.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.41,1:24:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love you, Hong Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.12,1:24:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.91,1:25:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.93,1:25:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You refused to date that\Ncivil servant or music teacher.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.77,1:25:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you suddenly want a housewife?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.65,1:25:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say that intern\Nwas going to get fired soon?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.40,1:26:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who's jobless?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.78,1:26:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to pressure you, but how\Nwill you save up money to buy a home?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.68,1:26:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.74,1:26:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect a wealthy daughter-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.12,1:26:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,just because you studied law at SNU.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.45,1:26:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hoped...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.91,1:26:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,she wouldn't be poorer than us. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.21,1:26:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Exactly.\N- I've never felt this way before.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.50,1:26:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.26,1:26:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.47,1:26:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why her clothes\Nalways have holes in them.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.35,1:26:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried that she'll\Ngo around kicking things.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.56,1:26:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried that she'll be scolded again.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.06,1:26:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think of her when I eat tasty food.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.02,1:26:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to bring her some.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.27,1:26:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so distracted...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.69,1:26:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,because of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.74,1:26:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be the death of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.95,1:26:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then marry her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.33,1:26:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Honey.\N- Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.00,1:26:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Marry her if it's that serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.12,1:26:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.96,1:27:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.88,1:27:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.22,1:27:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to get married,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.18,1:27:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll protect her forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.82,1:27:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.97,1:27:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Are there women whose hearts still race...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.98,1:28:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}when they see their husbands,\Ndespite being married...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.31,1:28:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}for over three years?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.90,1:28:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}No way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.19,1:28:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I noticed the fence was pried open.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.65,1:28:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}You actually believe he loves you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.32,1:28:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Yes, I do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.70,1:28:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I've never been this annoyed\Nwith someone's smile.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.66,1:28:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'm going to kill...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.12,1:28:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}every single scumbag who betrays...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.46,1:28:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}and stabs me in the back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.25,1:28:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Don't be afraid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.67,1:28:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}It was because I was scared.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.96,1:28:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}That's why my heart was racing so much.{\i0}
